<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA says it has issued 48 million American-style call and put warrants in marks, in 12 tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index.</p>
<p>There are six tranches of call warrants, one tranche of 1.0 million warrants and a further five tranches of 5.0 million warrants each.  There are also six tranches of put warrants, two tranches comprising of 1.0 million warrants and four of 5.0 million warrants.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAY DATE     04.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
